# ── Build request ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

@When "^maker has valid data for StepOutFull event$"
    Given build json request from current scenario with trade id from stored variable 'createdTradeId' as user 'maker@example.com'

# ── Make api call ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

@When "^performs the StepOutFull event via api$"
    When post to path '/trades/trigger-event'
    And attach the response body to the report

# ── Assertions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@Then "^the StepOutFull event is executed successfully$"
    Then the 'StepOutFull' should be 'executed' successfully

@Then "^the original trade is closed as Novated after StepOutFull$"
    Then maker retrieves the trade for stored variable 'createdTradeId'
    And response body contains a key 'data.trade.basic.status' as 'Dead'
    And response body contains a key 'data.trade.basic.eventStatus' as 'Novated'
